BE-300 2.6.8.1: Stowaway keyboard, touch panel and button input drivers.

  * stowaway.c: port of the 2.4.18 stowaway_be300.c (patches 0001+0015):
    polled dock handshake + scancode decode on the VRC4173 SIU, and the
    be300_stowaway_owns_uart flag that keeps ttyS0 and the boot console
    off the shared UART while the dock is probed/connected.
  * touch.c: port of the 2.4.18 touch_be300.c (0001+0010): VRC4173 PIU
    polled at 50 Hz, ABS_X/ABS_Y/ABS_PRESSURE/BTN_TOUCH in screen pixels.
  * keys.c: the 4.2.9 polled button driver on a kernel timer.

Link order gives the same evdev minors as the 2.4 image: event0 =
Stowaway, event1 = touch, event2 = buttons.

